@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
title Fixed papercut screen layout

component "Welcome / Setup / Home" as Features
component "PapercutScreen<Header, Content>" as Screen
component "Fixed header\nSafe-area inset + opaque wave" as Header
component "Native vertical ScrollView\nFeature content" as Scroll
component "PapercutBackground\nSky + landscape" as Background

Features --> Screen : header, content, scroll identity
Screen --> Background : back layer
Screen --> Scroll : middle layer
Screen --> Header : front layer

note right of Header
  Content scrolls behind the curved edge.
  Header height follows its content and Dynamic Type.
  The wave amplitude stays fixed as the header grows.
  Controls stay inside the safe area.
  The opaque paper consumes taps over covered content.
end note

note bottom of Scroll
  Setup progress scrolls with its step.
  A step change resets only the scroll content.
  Native keyboard avoidance and focus remain active.
  Automatic top scroll-edge effects are hidden.
end note

note left of Features
  Existing actions and busy states remain feature-owned.
  Everything stays inside the existing privacy protection.
  Server details and replacement sheets are unchanged.
end note
@enduml
